title Dodging artillery
about Spotted for by raiders, artillery shells two tank columns: one holds still, one keeps turning.

scenario skirmish
units 0
respawn off
bot blue off
bot red off
clip 0..900
camera 265,200 135

# Two batteries, each nearest one column, out of the tanks' reach. Artillery
# outranges its own sight (26), so each battery has a raider spotting for it,
# 40 units from its column: every tank (the column is ~12 wide) is inside a
# raider's sight (48) and none can see or reach the raider (32).
at 0    spawn red artillery 15 at 220,150 radius 6
at 0    spawn red artillery 15 at 310,150 radius 6
at 0    spawn red raider 1 at 220,175 radius 0
at 0    spawn red raider 1 at 312,175 radius 0
at 0    spawn blue tank 20 at 220,215 radius 6
at 0    spawn blue tank 20 at 310,215 radius 6

at 1    select blue tank within 20 of 220,215 as still
at 1    select blue tank within 20 of 310,215 as dodging

# Reverse every two seconds: shells lead the target's velocity at launch and
# fly for about three seconds, so a column that keeps turning isn't there.
at 2    move dodging 335,215
at 60   move dodging 290,215
at 120  move dodging 335,215
at 180  move dodging 290,215
at 240  move dodging 335,215
at 300  move dodging 290,215
at 360  move dodging 335,215
at 420  move dodging 290,215
at 480  move dodging 335,215
at 540  move dodging 290,215
at 600  move dodging 335,215
at 660  move dodging 290,215
at 720  move dodging 335,215
at 780  move dodging 290,215
at 840  move dodging 335,215

at 880  expect still alive <= 10     # observed 6 of 20
at 880  expect dodging alive >= 13   # observed 16 of 20: well over double
